{"nodes": [{"id": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_list_rfq_user", "label": "listRfqUser Use Cases", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "One query drives the user and DIC dashboard; card identity is the combination of vendor_sequence, vc_group, dic_group, ms_group and cs_id, and card status follows the priority Need Action over Waiting Vendor over highest remaining milestone.", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/listRfqUser-usecases.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_s3_decline_hide_filter", "label": "s3DeclineHideFilter", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "In parallel mode with no DIC verdict yet, declined and expired vendors are hidden while any sibling is still active, so the card shows the live vendor rather than a dead one.", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/listRfqUser-usecases.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_s3_dic_declined_hide_filter", "label": "s3DicDeclinedHideFilter", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Applies only when status_dic is non-null and DECLINED, which is why a null status_dic keeps the row visible.", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/listRfqUser-usecases.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_seq1_exclude_filter", "label": "seq1ExcludeFilter", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "An item that has moved to a later sequence must not also render under its earlier one, so sequence 1 and 2 rows are suppressed once the same item and vendor exist at sequence 3.", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/listRfqUser-usecases.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_vc_group", "label": "vc_group Card Grouping Key", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Zero merges vendors into one card, the vendor_code splits them per vendor, and minus one collects declined and expired parallel vendors into a single Waiting Procurement card.", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/listRfqUser-usecases.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_ms_group", "label": "ms_group Milestone Grouping Key", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Separates manual-sourcing items and OE-revision items from normal ones so a single vendor with mixed item states renders as distinct cards with correct labels.", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/listRfqUser-usecases.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_po_published_sibling_hide_filter", "label": "poPublishedSiblingHideFilter", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Deliberately RFQ-wide rather than item-scoped because it exists to compute Not Awarded, which is a cross-item question.", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/listRfqUser-usecases.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_need_action_dic_filter", "label": "needActionDicFilter", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "A card cannot demand DIC action when the DIC token is missing or expired, so those rows are dropped rather than shown as actionable.", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/listRfqUser-usecases.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_items_wp", "label": "items_wp Waiting Procurement Items", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Mirrors s3DeclineHideFilter at the items-array level, excluding rows whose sibling is still active or accepted with DIC not final, so the card body agrees with the row-level filter.", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/listRfqUser-usecases.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_list_rfq_user", "target": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_vc_group", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/listRfqUser-usecases.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_list_rfq_user", "target": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_ms_group", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/listRfqUser-usecases.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_list_rfq_user", "target": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_s3_decline_hide_filter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/listRfqUser-usecases.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_list_rfq_user", "target": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_s3_dic_declined_hide_filter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/listRfqUser-usecases.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_list_rfq_user", "target": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_seq1_exclude_filter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/listRfqUser-usecases.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "aigen_backend_docs_listrfquser_usecases_list_rfq_user", "target": "aigen_backend_